{"id":646,"date":"2021-02-09T22:06:45","date_gmt":"2021-02-09T22:06:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/?page_id=646"},"modified":"2023-08-14T11:17:15","modified_gmt":"2023-08-14T11:17:15","slug":"travel-agency-merchant-accounts","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/travel-agency-merchant-accounts\/","title":{"rendered":"Save money with the right travel merchant account"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 fusion-flex-container fusion-parallax-none banner-frame-colored top contain-background tailoredpay-view-more-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0);background-image: url(&quot;https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1043.svg&quot;);background-image:linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafd 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 30%),url(https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1043.svg);background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color:#e2e2e2;border-style:solid;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;\" id=\"sticky-sidebar-container\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"max-width:1216.8px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_2_3 2_3 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\" style=\"color:#788295;font-family:&quot;Circular Std Book&quot;;font-weight:400;\"><h2><strong>Merchant accounts for travel businesses<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you a travel business looking to expand and maximize your profits? If so, having a travel merchant account is essential. A travel merchant account gives you the flexibility and security to take customer payments quickly and securely.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, because the travel industry is considered high risk by most banks and payment processors, getting a travel merchant account can be tricky. In this article, we&#8217;ll discuss travel merchant accounts, why they are essential for travel businesses, and how you can find the right one to meet your needs.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What is a travel merchant account?<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A travel merchant account is a type of bank account that enables travel businesses to accept payment cards and electronic payments.\u00a0<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In short, travel merchant accounts are <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/high-risk-merchant-account\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">high risk merchant accounts<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for travel businesses. Travel merchant accounts make it easy for customers to book travel expenses such as flights, hotels, car rentals and more. Businesses with a travel merchant account can accept payment online, over the phone, or in person. Customers can pay by credit card, debit card, or electronic payment.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What businesses need a travel merchant account?<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Businesses operating in the travel industry and wanting to accept electronic payments generally need a travel merchant account. But how do you know if your business is officially a \u201ctravel\u201d business? Your merchant category code (MCC) will often determine if your business is a \u201ctravel\u201d business. For example, lodging businesses have MCCs in the 3500-3999 range.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Additionally, common travel businesses include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airlines<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cruise lines<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hotels<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Car rental companies<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel agents<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ticket sales<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Timeshares<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Booking sites<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel merchant accounts challenges<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many banks consider travel businesses to be high risk because of:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Chargeback and fraud risk<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. The risk of <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/faq-items\/what-is-a-chargeback\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">chargebacks<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/payment-fraud\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">payment fraud<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> increases the travel industry\u2019s risk profile.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>High transaction amounts.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Travel is expensive, making travel-related purchases an attractive target for fraudsters.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Prepaid expenses.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Travel businesses often require customers to purchase services in advance, making it difficult to cancel or refund if they don\u2019t receive what they have paid for or if their plans change.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Bankruptcy. <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The travel industry has a history of bankruptcies, which makes banks hesitant to take on travel business accounts and can result in high account fees.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because banks view the industry as high risk, travel businesses often face higher <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/merchant-account-fees\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">merchant account fees<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. In other cases, their merchant account applications are simply rejected. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-builder-row-inner fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"width:104% !important;max-width:104% !important;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column_inner fusion-builder-nested-column-0 fusion_builder_column_inner_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-image: url(&#039;https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/Mask-Group-1.svg&#039;);background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 12px;border-radius:12px 12px 12px 12px;overflow:hidden;padding: 55px 0px 55px 0px;\" data-bg-url=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/Mask-Group-1.svg\"><style type=\"text\/css\">@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-title.fusion-title-1{margin-top:0px!important; margin-right:0px!important;margin-bottom:20px!important;margin-left:0px!important;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-title.fusion-title-1{margin-top:10px!important; margin-right:0px!important;margin-bottom:10px!important; margin-left:0px!important;}}<\/style><div class=\"fusion-title title fusion-title-1 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-center fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-two\" style=\"font-size:26px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0px;\"><h2 class=\"title-heading-center fusion-responsive-typography-calculated\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Circular Std Medium&quot;;font-weight:400;margin:0;font-size:1em;color:#2d3946;--fontSize:26;line-height:1.65;\">Secure your payment processing today.<\/h2><\/div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-button.button-1 .fusion-button-text, .fusion-button.button-1 i {color:#ffffff;}.fusion-button.button-1 .fusion-button-icon-divider{border-color:#ffffff;}.fusion-button.button-1:hover .fusion-button-text, .fusion-button.button-1:hover i,.fusion-button.button-1:focus .fusion-button-text, .fusion-button.button-1:focus i,.fusion-button.button-1:active .fusion-button-text, .fusion-button.button-1:active{color:#ffffff;}.fusion-button.button-1:hover .fusion-button-icon-divider, .fusion-button.button-1:hover .fusion-button-icon-divider, .fusion-button.button-1:active .fusion-button-icon-divider{border-color:#ffffff;}.fusion-button.button-1:hover, .fusion-button.button-1:focus, .fusion-button.button-1:active{border-color:#ffffff;}.fusion-button.button-1 {border-color:#ffffff;border-radius:6px;}.fusion-button.button-1{background: #4185f4;}.fusion-button.button-1:hover,.button-1:focus,.fusion-button.button-1:active{background: #4185f4;}.fusion-button.button-1 .fusion-button-text {text-transform:uppercase;}<\/style><a class=\"fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-custom button-1 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type colored-divider-button\" target=\"_self\" href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\"><span class=\"fusion-button-text fusion-button-text-right\">Learn More<\/span><span class=\"fusion-button-icon-divider button-icon-divider-right\"><i class=\"fa-angle-right fas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/i><\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-0{width:100% !important;margin-top : 15px;margin-bottom : 35px;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 55px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 1.92%;padding-bottom : 55px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 1.92%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-2 fusion-text-no-margin\" style=\"margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:50px;\"><h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to get out of bad travel merchant account contracts<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sometimes travel merchants get stuck with bad merchant account contracts. What makes a merchant account \u201cbad\u201d varies, but common examples include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">High fees<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Terms that constrain your business<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poor customer service<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/chargeback-mitigation\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">chargeback mitigation<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fortunately, there&#8217;s still hope if you are stuck in a bad contract. Some potential ways to get out of a bad contract include:<\/span><b><\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Paying an early termination fee<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; You can often pay a fee to exit your contract.\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Finding a reason for a free exit<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; There are several reasons you may be able to end a contract early. In some states, there is up to a three month period after a rate hike where you can exit.\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Work with the processor<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8211; Sometimes, your existing processor will let you out of the contract even if there is no legal obligation to do so.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a deeper dive on these tips, check out our <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/how-to-get-out-of-a-merchant-services-contract\/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to get out of a merchant services contract<\/span><\/i><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> article.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How a travel merchant account with TailoredPay can help protect your business<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As the travel industry continues to innovate by offering travelers new ways to explore, businesses in the sector need to remain competitive. Reliable, secure payment processing solutions are necessary to do so, and that\u2019s why TailoredPay exists.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At TailoredPay, we understand the unique needs and risks of the travel industry. That&#8217;s why our travel merchant accounts are designed with your specific needs in mind. With TailoredPay, you can rest assured that your business is protected, allowing you to focus on growing your reach and maximizing profits.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Want to see how much you can save with TailoredPay? Check out our <\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/calculator\/#calculator\"><b>interactive savings calculator<\/b><\/a><b>!<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TailoredPay specializes in providing travel merchant accounts with unbeatable protection against fraud and chargebacks. Our team of experts is well-versed in best practices for travel businesses, and we take great care to ensure your account is secure.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-builder-row-inner fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"width:104% !important;max-width:104% !important;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column_inner fusion-builder-nested-column-1 fusion_builder_column_inner_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n<div class=\"table-2 tailoredpay-featured-table style-1\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">TailoredPay<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Digital application process<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Approvals within 48-72 hours<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">No setup fees<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Wide range of industries accepted<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Focus on high-risk merchants<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Chargeback prevention system<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-1{width:50% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-1 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 3.84%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 3.84%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-1{width:50% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-1 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 3.84%;margin-left : 3.84%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-1{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-1 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column_inner fusion-builder-nested-column-2 fusion_builder_column_inner_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n<div class=\"table-2 tailoredpay-featured-table style-2\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Traditional Providers<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Digital application process<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Approvals within 48-72 hours<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">No setup fees<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Wide range of industries accepted<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Focus on high-risk merchants<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Chargeback prevention system<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-2{width:50% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-2 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 3.84%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 3.84%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-2{width:50% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-2 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 3.84%;margin-left : 3.84%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-nested-column-2{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-nested-column-2 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\" style=\"margin-top:40px;\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We provide travel merchant accounts with:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Secure payment processing.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> TailoredPay offers cutting-edge security and encryption for online payments to help protect your business from fraudulent activity and chargebacks.<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/chargeback-mitigation\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Learn how our chargeback mitigation tools give you more control over your business.<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Payment flexibility<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. We offer seamless platform integration with multiple payment gateways, allowing you to<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/payment-gateways\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">choose the one that&#8217;s right for you<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Our global network of processing partners gives you the freedom to accept payments from customers around the world.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Competitive rates and fees. <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our travel merchant accounts are customized to meet your needs and come with no hidden fees, so you can stay on top of your finances and focus on growing your business.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Expert customer support. <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You&#8217;ll have access to our dedicated team of experts to answer any questions or concerns you may have.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/signup.tailoredpay.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sign up for a secure travel merchant account with TailoredPay<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to take advantage of our unbeatable protection against fraud and chargebacks. If you have questions about travel merchant accounts, <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/faq\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">contact our team of experts<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to learn more about how TailoredPay can help protect your travel business.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:66.666666666667% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 2.88%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 2.88%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0